[{"text": "The assembly will hear an address by his", "start": 1.88, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "Excellency Janez Jan\u0161a,", "start": 3.56, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "Prime Minister of the Republic of", "start": 6.08, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "Slovenia.", "start": 7.76, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 9.28, "duration": 2.92}, {"text": "Excellency", "start": 10.96, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "and invite him to address the assembly.", "start": 12.2, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": ">> Mr. President, excellencies,", "start": 27.84, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "distinguished delegates,", "start": 30.32, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "allow me", "start": 35.08, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "to begin my speech by quoting the", "start": 36.32, "duration": 8.2}, {"text": "sentences that I delivered uh", "start": 40.6, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "14 years ago", "start": 44.52, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "on this rostrum", "start": 46.96, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "on behalf of Slovenia.", "start": 48.96, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "And also on behalf of vast number of", "start": 52.16, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "current and former heads of states at", "start": 54.52, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "that time", "start": 57.04, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "who signed our declaration for and uh", "start": 59.04, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "allow me to quote.", "start": 62.76, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "This was uh", "start": 67.16, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "14 years ago.", "start": 68.76, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "This year's", "start": 71.12, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "theme of the United Nations Assembly is", "start": 72.48, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "peaceful resolution of disputes.", "start": 74.96, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Last year we celebrated the 60th", "start": 79.16, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "anniversary of the entry into force of", "start": 82.16, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "the Convention on Prevention and", "start": 84.76, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "Punishment of the Crime of Genocide.", "start": 87.68, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "The convention was the fruit of the", "start": 91.2, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "tireless effort of the Polish jurist", "start": 93.16, "duration": 7.72}, {"text": "of Jewish descent, Raphael Lemkin.", "start": 96.92, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "I would like to remind you that since", "start": 100.88, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "the end of the Second World War alone,", "start": 102.56, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "there have been more than 80 countries", "start": 105.8, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "witnessing mass atrocities. At least 53", "start": 108.2, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "million innocent people lost their", "start": 111.88, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "lives.", "start": 113.76, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "And behind these numbers are concrete", "start": 115.64, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "men and women", "start": 118.0, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "as well as children.", "start": 119.8, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "They had a future", "start": 122.28, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "but they were not allowed to live that", "start": 124.0, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "future.", "start": 126.12, "duration": 3.16}, {"text": "For this reason", "start": 127.6, "duration": 3.12}, {"text": "I call on the member states of the", "start": 129.28, "duration": 3.16}, {"text": "United Nations", "start": 130.72, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "original organizations and the United", "start": 132.44, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Nations system", "start": 135.12, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "to develop a new approach and a strategy", "start": 136.84, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "for the prevention of genocide and other", "start": 139.76, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "mass atrocities.", "start": 142.48, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "In addition", "start": 145.12, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "an intergovernmental forum of", "start": 146.8, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "like-minded states should be established", "start": 148.92, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "in order to propose", "start": 150.959, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "a United Nations resolution that would", "start": 153.2, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "give a clear mandate for preparation and", "start": 155.36, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "adoption of an appropriate legal", "start": 158.32, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "mechanism.", "start": 161.0, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "Legal mechanism that would give the", "start": 162.64, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "concept of the respons- responsibility", "start": 164.76, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "to protect", "start": 168.16, "duration": 3.12}, {"text": "a new tool.", "start": 169.76, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "A legal mechanism that will enforce the", "start": 171.28, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "prevention of crime, a mechanism that", "start": 173.28, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "will enable a faster and more effective", "start": 175.28, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "response to acts of genocide and other", "start": 177.44, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "mass atrocities.", "start": 180.44, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "I would like to inform you that this", "start": 182.64, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "initiative also comes from international", "start": 183.959, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "civil society.", "start": 186.28, "duration": 3.959}, {"text": "The Institute for Cultural Diplomacy has", "start": 188.239, "duration": 4.601}, {"text": "gathered thousands of supporters and", "start": 190.239, "duration": 3.601}, {"text": "inter-", "start": 192.84, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "international non-governmental", "start": 193.84, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "organizations among lawyers, lawyers,", "start": 195.84, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "students, journalists and others.", "start": 198.76, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "As early as 1960-", "start": 202.08, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "1946", "start": 204.76, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "Raphael Lemkin declared", "start": 206.92, "duration": 5.319}, {"text": "\"Our heritage is the result of the", "start": 210.08, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "contribution of all nations.", "start": 212.239, "duration": 5.401}, {"text": "All nations, as well as the United", "start": 215.64, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "Nations as a whole,", "start": 217.64, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "have great responsibility as as well as", "start": 219.4, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "an enormous opportunity", "start": 222.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "to prevent atrocities in the future.", "start": 224.92, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "We cannot escape history", "start": 228.0, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "but we can learn something from it.", "start": 230.44, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "I firmly believe that the mistakes we", "start": 233.6, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "made yesterday,", "start": 235.76, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "we do not want to repeat tomorrow.", "start": 237.32, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "We took", "start": 240.16, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "We We took responsibility", "start": 241.08, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "for this world from our fathers,", "start": 243.52, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "and we have a great responsibility to", "start": 246.24, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "make it better for our children.", "start": 248.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "I call on you to improve it by joining", "start": 251.24, "duration": 4.839}, {"text": "all our efforts for a world free from", "start": 254.04, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "genocide and", "start": 256.079, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "other", "start": 258.48, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "mass atrocities. End of quote.", "start": 259.799, "duration": 7.081}, {"text": "This was was 14 years ago.", "start": 263.44, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "After 14 years,", "start": 266.88, "duration": 3.16}, {"text": "I know that", "start": 268.64, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "despite the great initial support,", "start": 270.04, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "our initiative has not been realized.", "start": 273.08, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "And we can all say that", "start": 276.64, "duration": 7.16}, {"text": "today world is not better. It's worse.", "start": 280.08, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "This initiative has been drowned in new", "start": 283.8, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "crisis,", "start": 286.0, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "in the incompetence and ignorance of the", "start": 287.56, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "individuals and institutions", "start": 290.68, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "responsible,", "start": 292.64, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "and in the double standards that have", "start": 294.28, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "further marked the behavior of our", "start": 296.88, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "United Nations.", "start": 299.16, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "And sadly, today", "start": 302.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "we are even further away from the goal", "start": 304.72, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "we tried to achieve 14 years ago.", "start": 306.8, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "The theme of this year's season,", "start": 311.2, "duration": 3.04}, {"text": "therefore,", "start": 313.08, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "actually where is actually very well", "start": 314.24, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "chosen.", "start": 316.919, "duration": 4.921}, {"text": "Restoring trust.", "start": 318.56, "duration": 3.28}, {"text": "A United Nations that is here for", "start": 322.08, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "everyone.", "start": 324.64, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Of course,", "start": 326.88, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "trust begins with a simple question.", "start": 329.2, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Do we apply our principles consistently,", "start": 332.4, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "or only when it is politically", "start": 336.56, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "convenient?", "start": 338.84, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "The United Nations was founded on", "start": 340.68, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "universal principles.", "start": 342.72, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "Sovereignty, equal dignity, the rule of", "start": 344.96, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "law,", "start": 347.64, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "the peaceful settlement of disputes, and", "start": 348.6, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "the protection of human rights.", "start": 351.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "But principles lose their meaning", "start": 354.52, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "when they're applied selectively.", "start": 357.44, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "Now,", "start": 361.0, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "Mr. President, distinguished delegates,", "start": 361.8, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "let us be concrete.", "start": 364.76, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "For decades, the United Nations has", "start": 366.48, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "devoted significant institutional", "start": 369.16, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "attention", "start": 371.88, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "to the question of Palestine.", "start": 373.24, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "The General Assembly has adopted a", "start": 376.2, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "resolution after resolution, while the", "start": 378.24, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "Security Council and Human Rights", "start": 380.56, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "Council have repeatedly addressed the", "start": 382.44, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "situation.", "start": 384.68, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "Let me be clear.", "start": 386.04, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "The search for peace and security in the", "start": 387.88, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Middle East is of profound importance,", "start": 390.44, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "and the suffering of Palestinian and", "start": 394.04, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "also Israeli civilians", "start": 396.64, "duration": 4.279}, {"text": "deserves serious and sustained", "start": 398.8, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "consideration.", "start": 400.919, "duration": 4.841}, {"text": "Every civilian life matters.", "start": 402.48, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "But we are applying the same But", "start": 405.76, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "are we applying the same standard of", "start": 408.52, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "urgency when victims are elsewhere?", "start": 411.28, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "Last year alone,", "start": 414.8, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "over 4,800", "start": 416.44, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "Christians were killed", "start": 418.52, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "because of their religion.", "start": 420.28, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Millions Christians around the world", "start": 423.72, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "suffer discrimination and persecution.", "start": 427.0, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "In Iran,", "start": 430.44, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "the criminal theocratic regime", "start": 432.2, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "has brutally murdered tens of thousands", "start": 434.52, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "of its own citizens", "start": 437.0, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "this year alone.", "start": 439.36, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "After 1948, more than 1 million Jews", "start": 441.96, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "fled or were expelled from Arab", "start": 445.72, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "countries, many amid persecution and", "start": 447.76, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "violence.", "start": 450.919, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "Or consider Nigeria.", "start": 452.76, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "For more than a decade,", "start": 455.4, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Nigerian communities have faced mass", "start": 457.44, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "killings, kidnappings,", "start": 459.72, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "the destruction of villages and places", "start": 462.08, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "of worship,", "start": 464.64, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "and the displacements of hundreds of", "start": 466.04, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "thousands of people.", "start": 468.56, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "In return,", "start": 470.96, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "this body", "start": 472.4, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "produced a single Security Council", "start": 473.96, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "resolution.", "start": 476.36, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "Not 70, not 17, one.", "start": 477.72, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "So,", "start": 482.16, "duration": 3.04}, {"text": "we must ask,", "start": 483.4, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "if every civilian life matters,", "start": 485.2, "duration": 7.24}, {"text": "why does our urgency seem so different", "start": 488.4, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "from one crisis to another?", "start": 492.44, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "This does not mean", "start": 495.44, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "caring less about one crisis,", "start": 496.96, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "but caring more consistently about all", "start": 499.96, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "of them.", "start": 503.28, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "We must also be willing to ask difficult", "start": 505.52, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "questions about how Palestine is", "start": 507.88, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "discussed and used politically.", "start": 510.76, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "Majority position does not by itself", "start": 514.08, "duration": 5.079}, {"text": "determine what is right.", "start": 516.599, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "The right of a democratic state and its", "start": 519.159, "duration": 4.201}, {"text": "people to defend themselves against", "start": 521.4, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "terrorism", "start": 523.36, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "must be recognized and upheld not only", "start": 524.72, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "in the words.", "start": 527.48, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "Civilian suffering is tragic and must be", "start": 528.96, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "addressed,", "start": 531.68, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "but it can never justify", "start": 533.44, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "terrorism or the pursuit of political", "start": 535.92, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "objectives through violence.", "start": 538.28, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "At the same time,", "start": 541.0, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "criticism of government policy must", "start": 542.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "never become a cover for anti-Semitism.", "start": 545.64, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "If civilian lives are equal, our", "start": 549.44, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "attention should be guided by the scale,", "start": 551.76, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "duration, and", "start": 555.0, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "severity of suffering, not primarily by", "start": 556.8, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "geography,", "start": 560.24, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "political alliances, media visibility,", "start": 561.56, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "or political influence.", "start": 564.12, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "These principles must also guide our", "start": 567.24, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "approach to Belarus.", "start": 569.76, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "We condemn the authoritarian systemic", "start": 572.08, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "repression,", "start": 574.4, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "arbitrary detention and persecution of", "start": 576.24, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "political opponents, human rights", "start": 578.48, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "defenders, and independent voices.", "start": 580.52, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "All political prisoners must must be", "start": 583.56, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "released immediately and", "start": 585.72, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "unconditionally, and those responsible", "start": 587.16, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "for human rights violations must be held", "start": 589.72, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "accountable.", "start": 591.96, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "We should speak about this.", "start": 593.16, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Slovenia stands with the Belarussian", "start": 595.76, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "people and supports", "start": 598.28, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "a peaceful democratic transformation", "start": 600.32, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "founded on free and fair elections, the", "start": 602.68, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "rule of law,", "start": 604.84, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "and full respect for human rights.", "start": 606.2, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Belarus belongs in a free and democratic", "start": 610.64, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Europe.", "start": 614.16, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Distinguished delegates,", "start": 616.0, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "selectivity", "start": 619.04, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "does more than", "start": 620.92, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "distort our attention over time.", "start": 622.56, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "It destroys institutions themselves.", "start": 625.84, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "The United Nations cannot defend the", "start": 629.84, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "rule of law while silently watching its", "start": 631.84, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "own mandates.", "start": 634.4, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Procedures and institutions become", "start": 636.36, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "instrument of political convenience.", "start": 638.64, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "The rule of law must never become merely", "start": 642.48, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "rule by law.", "start": 645.16, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "It requires rules to be applied", "start": 646.8, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "impartially, consistently, and", "start": 648.96, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "transparently.", "start": 651.76, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "When the same principles are invoked", "start": 653.76, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "strictly in one case", "start": 656.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and conveniently overlooked in another,", "start": 658.24, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "we do not strengthen international law.", "start": 661.56, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "We hollow it out.", "start": 663.72, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "We hollow it out.", "start": 665.24, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "And when institutions created to protect", "start": 667.2, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "universal standards are", "start": 669.32, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "instrumentalized for political purposes,", "start": 671.44, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "we weaken the very multilateral system", "start": 674.88, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "they were created to defend.", "start": 678.08, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "This inconsistency", "start": 680.76, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "is particularly difficult to ignore when", "start": 682.8, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "we consider Iran.", "start": 685.04, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Executions, including those involving", "start": 686.92, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "political prisoners,", "start": 689.28, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "young intellectuals, and other and", "start": 691.2, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "others who oppose the regime", "start": 693.84, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "demand serious attention,", "start": 696.12, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "not the words", "start": 698.44, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "with the functions in the United", "start": 700.28, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "Nations.", "start": 702.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "And yet, there is often no sufficiently", "start": 703.96, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "serious condemnation of these executions", "start": 706.8, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "or of the broader violation of human", "start": 709.48, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "rights under our system", "start": 711.72, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "that seeks complete control over social,", "start": 714.56, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "political, and economic life.", "start": 716.72, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "The abuse of religion to justif- to", "start": 720.4, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "justify or reinforce such control", "start": 723.0, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "is another example of how principles can", "start": 726.32, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "be distorted", "start": 728.96, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "when institutions and political power", "start": 730.6, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "are placed above the rights and dignity", "start": 732.64, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "of individuals.", "start": 734.84, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "Human rights cannot depend on whether", "start": 737.2, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "the victims are politically", "start": 740.08, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "convenient to defend.", "start": 742.52, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "The United Nations must therefore defend", "start": 744.84, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "not only its institutions,", "start": 747.56, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "but also the integrity of the principles", "start": 750.08, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "those institutions exist to serve.", "start": 753.84, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "Distinguished delegates,", "start": 757.92, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Russia's war", "start": 760.36, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "of aggression against Ukraine", "start": 761.92, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "is a flagrant violation of the United", "start": 764.12, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "Nations Charter and a", "start": 766.28, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "direct assault on the sovereignty and", "start": 768.4, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "territorial integrity of a member state.", "start": 771.28, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "Russia's occupation and attempted", "start": 774.6, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "illegal annexation of Crimea", "start": 777.88, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "in 2014 challenged the fundamental rule", "start": 781.4, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "of our international order", "start": 784.76, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "territ- territory", "start": 786.88, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "cannot be acquired by force.", "start": 789.08, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "As Mustafa Dzhemilev, the leader of", "start": 791.96, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "Crimean Tatars, re- reminded us at", "start": 795.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "yesterday's Crimea Platform Summit,", "start": 798.48, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "the international re- response to", "start": 801.44, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "Russia's aggression in 2014", "start": 804.24, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "was too little, too late.", "start": 808.12, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Russia was never effectively stopped.", "start": 810.92, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Its impunity", "start": 814.28, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "began in Crimea.", "start": 816.04, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "The full-scale invasion", "start": 818.12, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "of 2022", "start": 820.72, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "was the consequence.", "start": 823.52, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "The Russian leadership chose this war.", "start": 825.88, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Russia is the aggressor.", "start": 828.72, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "Ukraine is defending its people and its", "start": 831.16, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "independence.", "start": 833.56, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "For my country, for Slovenia,", "start": 835.68, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "sovereignty and territorial integrity", "start": 837.44, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "are fundamental to our own security.", "start": 839.8, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "If a powerful state can", "start": 843.6, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "seize its neighbor's terri-", "start": 846.48, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "territory by force,", "start": 848.48, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "every smaller state becomes less secure.", "start": 850.52, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "The United Nations has documented", "start": 855.4, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "torture and executions of Ukrainian", "start": 857.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "prisoners of war by Russian forces,", "start": 860.44, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "as well as grave abuses in occupied", "start": 863.56, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "territory.", "start": 866.24, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Those responsible must face justice.", "start": 867.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Prisoners of war and civilian", "start": 871.36, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "detainees", "start": 873.44, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "must return home. Ukrainian children", "start": 874.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "forcibly transferred or deported must", "start": 877.48, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "return to their homes.", "start": 880.0, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "Our goal must remain a just and lasting", "start": 882.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "peace based on the United Nations", "start": 884.6, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Charter", "start": 887.72, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "and Ukraine's sovereignty and", "start": 889.0, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "territorial integrity.", "start": 890.92, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "Ukraine must participate fully in", "start": 893.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "decision concerning its future.", "start": 896.56, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "Any settlement must provide credible", "start": 899.44, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "security guarantees against renewed", "start": 901.72, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "aggression.", "start": 903.96, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "And Slovenia will continue to support", "start": 905.88, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "Ukraine on its European path. Ukraine's", "start": 907.68, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "future belongs in the European Union.", "start": 910.32, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "A permanent member", "start": 914.2, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "of the Security Council of this", "start": 915.92, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "organization", "start": 918.04, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "entrusted with a special responsibility", "start": 919.52, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "for international peace", "start": 922.44, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "is waging war of aggression against", "start": 924.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "another member state.", "start": 926.92, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "is is", "start": 929.68, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "waging war against another member state.", "start": 931.76, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "And Russia's permanent seat", "start": 935.84, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "cannot place it above the charter.", "start": 938.24, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "Its veto cannot erase aggression or", "start": 942.08, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "responsibility for international crimes.", "start": 944.28, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "It is ruining the world order.", "start": 947.92, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "If this organization wants to restore", "start": 950.48, "duration": 2.88}, {"text": "trust", "start": 952.28, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "it should begin by applying its own", "start": 953.36, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "principle consistently.", "start": 955.48, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "I therefore propose two things. First", "start": 958.44, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "this organization should strengthen", "start": 961.48, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "transparency around", "start": 963.48, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "its responses to the crisis to crisis.", "start": 965.52, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "We should establish We should establish", "start": 969.16, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "an independent mechanism", "start": 971.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "answerable to this assembly as a whole", "start": 973.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "that annually", "start": 976.2, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "compares the scale, duration, and", "start": 978.0, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "severity of major crisis", "start": 980.76, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "with the scale and nature of the", "start": 983.24, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "international response.", "start": 984.8, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "Not to dictate political verdicts, but", "start": 987.16, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "to make it impossible for us to remain", "start": 989.8, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "unaware of our own patterns of", "start": 992.28, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "selectivity.", "start": 994.92, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "And second", "start": 996.76, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "we should strengthen safeguards against", "start": 998.36, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "the political instrumentalization of", "start": 1000.839, "duration": 3.721}, {"text": "United Nations", "start": 1002.8, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "of United Nations mandates and", "start": 1004.56, "duration": 4.279}, {"text": "institutions.", "start": 1006.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Their credibility depends on transparent", "start": 1008.839, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "procedures", "start": 1011.56, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "consistent criteria of scrutiny for all", "start": 1013.4, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "member states.", "start": 1017.04, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Distinguished delegates", "start": 1019.88, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "the multi-", "start": 1021.68, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "the multilateral system", "start": 1023.2, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "was created to prevent power from", "start": 1025.52, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "replacing principle.", "start": 1028.28, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "We must not allow political convenience", "start": 1030.72, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "to reverse that relationship", "start": 1033.0, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "so that principle becomes merely a", "start": 1035.8, "duration": 4.279}, {"text": "language used by institutions when it", "start": 1038.0, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "serves political interests.", "start": 1040.079, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "The answer is not to weaken", "start": 1043.24, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "multilateralism. It is to protect it", "start": 1045.52, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "from instrumentalization.", "start": 1048.16, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "A United Nations that delivers for all", "start": 1051.24, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "cannot mean an organization that", "start": 1054.24, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "responds loudly to some crisis and", "start": 1056.24, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "quietly to others.", "start": 1058.84, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "You want to speak credibly", "start": 1060.72, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "of the United Nations that delivers for", "start": 1062.88, "duration": 3.12}, {"text": "all,", "start": 1064.88, "duration": 2.8}, {"text": "but we must be prepared to ask a", "start": 1066.0, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "difficult question.", "start": 1067.68, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Does it really deliver for all?", "start": 1069.64, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "For those living through war, for those", "start": 1073.52, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "displaced by violence,", "start": 1076.24, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "for states, for states whose concerns", "start": 1078.8, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "receive little international attention,", "start": 1082.12, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "for families struggling to build a", "start": 1085.2, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "future,", "start": 1086.8, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "so, dear friends, we'll restore trust", "start": 1089.08, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "when a crisis matters", "start": 1091.64, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "because human beings are suffering, not", "start": 1094.08, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "be", "start": 1097.32, "duration": 3.16}, {"text": "not because the politics surrounding it", "start": 1098.12, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "are convenient.", "start": 1100.48, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "And we'll restore trust when the", "start": 1102.4, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "institutions of multilateralism", "start": 1104.48, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "are strong enough to serve universal", "start": 1107.28, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "principles rather than political", "start": 1109.52, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "convenience.", "start": 1111.64, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "But restoring trust", "start": 1113.48, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "is not only about correcting what is", "start": 1115.68, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "wrong today.", "start": 1118.36, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "It is about deciding", "start": 1119.92, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "It is about deciding what kind of of", "start": 1122.0, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "international system", "start": 1125.08, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "we are willing to pass on those who come", "start": 1126.84, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "after us.", "start": 1129.88, "duration": 2.72}, {"text": "A United Nations", "start": 1132.72, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "that cannot uphold its own principles", "start": 1134.48, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "has no standing to ask the world for its", "start": 1138.24, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "trust.", "start": 1141.76, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "What we owe the people of the world is", "start": 1143.84, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "not sentiment.", "start": 1146.28, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "It is an institution consistent enough", "start": 1148.04, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "and far-sighted enough", "start": 1152.4, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "to be worthy of their trust.", "start": 1155.04, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Thank you very much.", "start": 1158.24, "duration": 2.88}, {"text": ">> [applause]", "start": 1161.983, "duration": 2.02}, {"text": ">> On behalf of the Assembly, I wish to", "start": 1169.04, "duration": 3.28}, {"text": "thank the Prime Minister of the Republic", "start": 1170.52, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "of Slovenia.", "start": 1172.32, "duration": 2.88}]